WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

NOTE
Narration for ../demo/okf-publish-connected.mp4, the real terminal recording of live run kp-20260915t082018z-0387
(synthetic data, one run). Cue times come from the asciinema cast with idle waits capped at 3 s, the same
compression the mp4 was rendered with (92.72 s cast vs 92.75 s mp4), spot-checked on frames at 1, 27.8, 49.3 and 79 s.

setup
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.200
Can an AI agent answer “What was Acme’s gross margin?”
with the approved definition — and prove the number?

author
00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:11.700
Step 1 · Author: Finance’s Open Knowledge Format files
are compiled into one fixed version.

publish-write
00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:21.900
Step 2 · Publish in BigQuery: rows are written,
then every row is read back and checked.

publish-switch
00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:27.400
Ready. BigQuery now switches its
“current version” pointer in one step.

catalog
00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:31.200
Switched — BigQuery serves this version.
Step 3 · A Knowledge Catalog entry is written that points to it.

grant
00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:39.800
The agent’s restricted account is given read access.
(Waiting until it takes effect: 71 s, compressed.)

discover
00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:48.800
Step 4 · The agent finds the entry in Knowledge Catalog, pins that version,
and retrieves the definition and the approved calculation.

release
00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:51.800
Step 5 · The receipt checks out, so the number is released:
gross margin $400.00.

traps
00:00:51.800 --> 00:01:09.800
Traps: a swapped query, a rule the agent may not see,
and output it may not read — each one refused.

revoke
00:01:09.800 --> 00:01:18.500
Step 6 · Revoke: the agent’s access is removed…

refused
00:01:18.500 --> 00:01:24.100
…a fresh request, a shortcut through the old pin and the stored receipt
are all refused. The test tables and Catalog entry are deleted.

result
00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:26.700
The agent’s final answer gives the number and the verdicts,
with no job IDs, SQL or account names.

verdict
00:01:26.700 --> 00:01:32.750
One live run published in BigQuery, then the agent discovered,
used, verified, and was revoked — successfully.
